{"ref":"BDB, רֶ֫מֶשׂ","hw":"רֶ֫מֶשׂ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רֶ֫מֶשׂ</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.20\">Ez 38:20</a></sup> <strong>coll. creeping things, moving things</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.13\">1 K 5:13</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:20\" href=\"/Hosea.2.20\">Ho 2:20</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>creeping things</em> (disting. from <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהֵמָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיָּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עוֹף</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צִפּוֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּג</span>) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:20\" href=\"/Hosea.2.20\">Ho 2:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.13\">1 K 5:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.10\">Ez 8:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.20\">38:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:24\" href=\"/Genesis.1.24\">Gn 1:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:25\" href=\"/Genesis.1.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:26\" href=\"/Genesis.1.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:7\" href=\"/Genesis.6.7\">6:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:20\" href=\"/Genesis.6.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:14\" href=\"/Genesis.7.14\">7:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:23\" href=\"/Genesis.7.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:17\" href=\"/Genesis.8.17\">8:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:19\" href=\"/Genesis.8.19\">19</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:14\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.14\">Hb 1:14</a> (in sim.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 148:10\" href=\"/Psalms.148.10\">ψ 148:10</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  of sea animals, <em>gliding things</em>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:25\" href=\"/Psalms.104.25\">ψ 104:25</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>moving things</em>, of all animals <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:3\" href=\"/Genesis.9.3\">Gn 9:3</a> (P).—Cf. Dr<sup>Hast. DB Creeping Things</sup>.","next":"BDB, רֶמֶת","prev":"BDB, רָמַשׂ"}